(6710649, 1002717, 93565, '<td valign="top">The color of the sky is a bit off it seems, but I like the idea of this shot. I like scenes of synthetic alongside those which are natural, and you''ve done that well.</td>', 'The color of the sky is a bit off it seems, but I like the idea of this shot. I like scenes of synthetic alongside those which are natural, and you''ve done that well.', '2012-03-15 02:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710652, 1004546, 93565, '<td valign="top">The processing on this is really just stellar. It feels so authentically nostalgic and cinematic. Very interesting. Love the composition.</td>', 'The processing on this is really just stellar. It feels so authentically nostalgic and cinematic. Very interesting. Love the composition.', '2012-03-15 02:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710654, 1004636, 93565, '<td valign="top">Brennan?<br/>If this is yours, the editing fits, but I think this one is pushed a bit in any case, be it in search of a style or otherwise. The distortion is sorta cool though.</td>', 'Brennan?If this is yours, the editing fits, but I think this one is pushed a bit in any case, be it in search of a style or otherwise. The distortion is sorta cool though.', '2012-03-15 02:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710656, 1004497, 35545, '<td valign="top">Cool subject matter, but the tilted perspective is too distracting</td>', 'Cool subject matter, but the tilted perspective is too distracting', '2012-03-15 02:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710657, 1002093, 93565, '<td valign="top">Like a pointillist work with a blockprint. Interesting outcome, I like the way you''ve pushed photography towards other mediums.</td>', 'Like a pointillist work with a blockprint. Interesting outcome, I like the way you''ve pushed photography towards other mediums.', '2012-03-15 02:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710658, 1004636, 20577, '<td valign="top">Cheater</td>', 'Cheater', '2012-03-15 02:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710659, 1003470, 93565, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, the drop. There had to be one!<br/>All joking aside, I think this is pretty cool. I''m okay with the blurred splash, it almost makes it take on a separate character than what we normally associate with it.</td>', 'Ah yes, the drop. There had to be one!All joking aside, I think this is pretty cool. I''m okay with the blurred splash, it almost makes it take on a separate character than what we normally associate with it.', '2012-03-15 02:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710660, 1004569, 93565, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how surprisingly aimless this shot feels until you spot the person. It was almost startling to me. Cool.</td>', 'It''s amazing how surprisingly aimless this shot feels until you spot the person. It was almost startling to me. Cool.', '2012-03-15 02:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710661, 1002553, 40391, '<td valign="top">Intriguing yet haunting.  The details and blues are beautiful.</td>', 'Intriguing yet haunting.  The details and blues are beautiful.', '2012-03-15 02:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710662, 1002117, 93565, '<td valign="top">"State of Affairs"<br/> <br/>A rather surreal monument, really. Interesting shot.</td>', '"State of Affairs" A rather surreal monument, really. Interesting shot.', '2012-03-15 02:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710664, 1003840, 35545, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the motion blur.  Not so crazy about the white, letterbox frame.  It distracts me and draws my eye out of the frame.</td>', 'Love the colors and the motion blur.  Not so crazy about the white, letterbox frame.  It distracts me and draws my eye out of the frame.', '2012-03-15 02:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710667, 1004535, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice color treatment.</td>', 'Nice color treatment.', '2012-03-15 02:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710668, 1004618, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great perspective that is just mesmerising.</td>', 'Great perspective that is just mesmerising.', '2012-03-15 02:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710670, 1004439, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very cool landscape. Really like this. You sorta fall into it as you view it.</td>', 'Very cool landscape. Really like this. You sorta fall into it as you view it.', '2012-03-15 02:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710674, 1004610, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs some deep blacks for good contrast.</td>', 'Needs some deep blacks for good contrast.', '2012-03-15 02:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710675, 1002887, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.', '2012-03-15 02:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710676, 1001906, 93565, '<td valign="top">Extremely strong as a portrait. Very intense.</td>', 'Extremely strong as a portrait. Very intense.', '2012-03-15 02:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710679, 1002222, 93565, '<td valign="top">Jellyfish?<br/>Cool perspective, makes for a much more interest experience than just seeing the whole thing.</td>', 'Jellyfish?Cool perspective, makes for a much more interest experience than just seeing the whole thing.', '2012-03-15 02:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710680, 1002465, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2012-03-15 02:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710683, 1004272, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the energy of your shot. It''s lively, bright, and hopeful. Nice lines, the blur works well.</td>', 'I like the energy of your shot. It''s lively, bright, and hopeful. Nice lines, the blur works well.', '2012-03-15 02:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710684, 1004415, 93565, '<td valign="top">Man, it''s almost like an optical illusion if you try to stare "past" that screen at the moth. Neat effect.</td>', 'Man, it''s almost like an optical illusion if you try to stare "past" that screen at the moth. Neat effect.', '2012-03-15 02:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710685, 1002422, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMNSHO, would be begter if that strip of white at the top were cropped out.</td>', 'IMNSHO, would be begter if that strip of white at the top were cropped out.', '2012-03-15 02:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710687, 1004244, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is probably the spookiest horse photo I''ve ever seen. Pretty damn cool and extremely different approach to the majority of the equestrian photography I''ve seen.</td>', 'This is probably the spookiest horse photo I''ve ever seen. Pretty damn cool and extremely different approach to the majority of the equestrian photography I''ve seen.', '2012-03-15 02:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710688, 1004427, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting components but needs more contrast.</td>', 'Interesting components but needs more contrast.', '2012-03-15 02:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710690, 1001932, 40391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones, lovely image.</td>', 'Beautiful tones, lovely image.', '2012-03-15 02:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710693, 1003987, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful treatment and colors, but I wish the bird wasn''t dead center.</td>', 'Beautiful treatment and colors, but I wish the bird wasn''t dead center.', '2012-03-15 02:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710694, 1004061, 63244, '<td valign="top">Oh, I absolutely love this!  Very brights colors and lots of texture that literally pour down into much smoother, calmer,  minimal colors. Beautiful!</td>', 'Oh, I absolutely love this!  Very brights colors and lots of texture that literally pour down into much smoother, calmer,  minimal colors. Beautiful!', '2012-03-15 02:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710695, 1004618, 63244, '<td valign="top">Fantastic reflection shot! Beautiful in sepia, too! It reminds me of an Escher image!</td>', 'Fantastic reflection shot! Beautiful in sepia, too! It reminds me of an Escher image!', '2012-03-15 02:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710697, 1002090, 93565, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love how the throng of people looks like a cloud of smoke. This is just AWESOME.</td>', 'I absolutely love how the throng of people looks like a cloud of smoke. This is just AWESOME.', '2012-03-15 02:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710708, 1002604, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and artistic but I hate the title. Just "Laura'' would have sufficed.</td>', 'Nicely done and artistic but I hate the title. Just "Laura'' would have sufficed.', '2012-03-15 03:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710709, 1002233, 113156, '<td valign="top">Five bodhisattva''s out for a stroll, send them my way. Great texture and light and a very suitable image for this challenge.</td>', 'Five bodhisattva''s out for a stroll, send them my way. Great texture and light and a very suitable image for this challenge.', '2012-03-15 03:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710716, 1002000, 113156, '<td valign="top">Art is all around us, why get caught up analyzing everything when it''s always right in front of you, nice job.</td>', 'Art is all around us, why get caught up analyzing everything when it''s always right in front of you, nice job.', '2012-03-15 04:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710724, 1002155, 99263, '<td valign="top">Clever artistic idea and well executed. Something I appreciate. Another idea might have been to somehow have had your fingertips in the mulch between the roots creating the impression that the hand itself was also growing out of the ground like some kind of tree.</td>', 'Clever artistic idea and well executed. Something I appreciate. Another idea might have been to somehow have had your fingertips in the mulch between the roots creating the impression that the hand itself was also growing out of the ground like some kind of tree.', '2012-03-15 04:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
