(6710829, 1004088, 7889, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=61489" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/7889/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_61489.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/7889/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_61489.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/7889/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_61489.jpg"/></a> Similar to a shot a took back in Goa - Those bottle openers may get some comments !</td>', ' Similar to a shot a took back in Goa - Those bottle openers may get some comments !', '2012-03-15 07:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
