(6711072, 1004655, 138253, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and scenery :)</td>', 'Love the colours and scenery :)', '2012-03-15 11:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711076, 1004626, 43463, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors of gold and orange. It is like waves/ripples on the surface of the water. Texture, shape, and color are all spectacular in this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful colors of gold and orange. It is like waves/ripples on the surface of the water. Texture, shape, and color are all spectacular in this shot.', '2012-03-15 11:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711082, 1002524, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Fillory...as in the book Magicians? I love the processing that gives this a warm golden hue - like it is a pleasant memory being revisited. In some ways it has a ''textural'' feel that makes me think of a painting. The fields of gold are inviting to explore and the barn in the backdrop promises to be an interesting destination.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Fillory...as in the book Magicians? I love the processing that gives this a warm golden hue - like it is a pleasant memory being revisited. In some ways it has a ''textural'' feel that makes me think of a painting. The fields of gold are inviting to explore and the barn in the backdrop promises to be an interesting destination.', '2012-03-15 11:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711087, 1004279, 138253, '<td valign="top">interesting concept, would like to hear what (if any) meaning is behind this as i''ve stared at this for about 15 minutes coming up with several ridiculous hypotheses.</td>', 'interesting concept, would like to hear what (if any) meaning is behind this as i''ve stared at this for about 15 minutes coming up with several ridiculous hypotheses.', '2012-03-15 11:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
