(6711099, 1004159, 138253, '<td valign="top">A symbol meaning so many things to such a large percent of the world, yet such a simple design. Interesting with the circles on this one, haven''t really seen that pattern on it before.</td>', 'A symbol meaning so many things to such a large percent of the world, yet such a simple design. Interesting with the circles on this one, haven''t really seen that pattern on it before.', '2012-03-15 11:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
