(6711743, 1004641, 43463, '<td valign="top">And it is a tall tale indeed:-) I see the figures on the hillside and I can imagine the story the one is weaving for the other who sits and listens. The story, like the two palm trees, grows more stretched with the length of the tale that unfolds. I imagine the tale is one the reaches for the sky - I really want walk up the hillside to listen in and hear this giant whopper of a fable:-) Nicely captured - as you can tell it capture my imagination:-)</td>', 'And it is a tall tale indeed:-) I see the figures on the hillside and I can imagine the story the one is weaving for the other who sits and listens. The story, like the two palm trees, grows more stretched with the length of the tale that unfolds. I imagine the tale is one the reaches for the sky - I really want walk up the hillside to listen in and hear this giant whopper of a fable:-) Nicely captured - as you can tell it capture my imagination:-)', '2012-03-15 20:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711758, 1004166, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Composition and processing is perfect.</td>', 'Wonderful!  Composition and processing is perfect.', '2012-03-15 20:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
