(6711822, 1004671, 124982, '<td valign="top">Fantastically capture!! What a moment! Two spectacular birds...really wish the framing was a little tighter to really bring them to the forefront. Right now they kind of disappear into the image. Still, great image!</td>', 'Fantastically capture!! What a moment! Two spectacular birds...really wish the framing was a little tighter to really bring them to the forefront. Right now they kind of disappear into the image. Still, great image!', '2012-03-15 21:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711825, 1004236, 43463, '<td valign="top">Very minimalist - simple and elegant in presentation. The flow of shapes and colors is pleasing to the eye. The single person in the composition poses the question - by which way shall he/she travel. Land, water, and the sky; the third option that is available to man with the invention of the airplane. But then there is the observer watching the scene the travels too into this scene. Our mode of travel: imagination. Great work, hope to see this in the top 10.</td>', 'Very minimalist - simple and elegant in presentation. The flow of shapes and colors is pleasing to the eye. The single person in the composition poses the question - by which way shall he/she travel. Land, water, and the sky; the third option that is available to man with the invention of the airplane. But then there is the observer watching the scene the travels too into this scene. Our mode of travel: imagination. Great work, hope to see this in the top 10.', '2012-03-15 21:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711828, 1002843, 124982, '<td valign="top">Top 5 in my votes. Very sensual and tastefully done. Love the ephemeral feel to it..like she''s a dream.</td>', 'Top 5 in my votes. Very sensual and tastefully done. Love the ephemeral feel to it..like she''s a dream.', '2012-03-15 21:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711829, 1002090, 124982, '<td valign="top">Top 5 of the challenge for me. Really dying to know how you made the passengers turn to "smoky" ghosts.</td>', 'Top 5 of the challenge for me. Really dying to know how you made the passengers turn to "smoky" ghosts.', '2012-03-15 21:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711830, 1004236, 124982, '<td valign="top">One of the very few images in this challenge that inspired me to comment. The simplicity of this image, in both composition and tones really makes this such an easy image on the eye. Very soothing. COuld see this on my wall quite easily.<br/> <br/>EDIT: finished voting and this is quite clearly in the top 5.</td>', 'One of the very few images in this challenge that inspired me to comment. The simplicity of this image, in both composition and tones really makes this such an easy image on the eye. Very soothing. COuld see this on my wall quite easily. EDIT: finished voting and this is quite clearly in the top 5.', '2012-03-15 21:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711849, 1003945, 123833, '<td valign="top">No sense of motion to me but I like the colors and textures - are these scrambled eggs?</td>', 'No sense of motion to me but I like the colors and textures - are these scrambled eggs?', '2012-03-15 22:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
