(6711918, 1004659, 29011, '<td valign="top">The odd case of the prince and the pauper ;) I have an indoor feline friend of my own and have seen a similar scene a couple of times. Really like how you captured this with the hint of reflection in the window. (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'The odd case of the prince and the pauper ;) I have an indoor feline friend of my own and have seen a similar scene a couple of times. Really like how you captured this with the hint of reflection in the window. (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-15 23:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711919, 1004279, 29011, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I''d reckon it would work a bit better if the syringes were half depressed. At first I thought the almost alien like profile weird but with the concept at hand it actually works better. Like it''s been genetically modified via the substance it''s being injected with. (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'Interesting concept. I''d reckon it would work a bit better if the syringes were half depressed. At first I thought the almost alien like profile weird but with the concept at hand it actually works better. Like it''s been genetically modified via the substance it''s being injected with. (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-15 23:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711920, 1003218, 29011, '<td valign="top">I like the PP, and with the mood of the shot I can definitely see the title working. Manhunt was the first word to come to mind when seeing this. (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'I like the PP, and with the mood of the shot I can definitely see the title working. Manhunt was the first word to come to mind when seeing this. (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-15 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6711927, 1002005, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like the PP. It appears almost CGI like, which I do like here btw but don''t always ;) The HDR is done really well, no halos in sight, big plus! Except that I don''t get the really brownish like shadows of the vines on the wall? perhaps if it was a tad less saturated in the area it would''ve been less distracting. Cool shot overall. (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'Really like the PP. It appears almost CGI like, which I do like here btw but don''t always ;) The HDR is done really well, no halos in sight, big plus! Except that I don''t get the really brownish like shadows of the vines on the wall? perhaps if it was a tad less saturated in the area it would''ve been less distracting. Cool shot overall. (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-15 23:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712001, 1003382, 28359, '<td valign="top">Really like the soft colors &amp; feel to your image.</td>', 'Really like the soft colors & feel to your image.', '2012-03-16 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
