(6712244, 1003981, 49018, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of some immense, mythical animal stretching its neck out of the frame.<br/>Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Makes me think of some immense, mythical animal stretching its neck out of the frame.Interesting perspective.', '2012-03-16 08:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712250, 1003382, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the pale pastel hues and the feel of early morning in this composition. There is almost a rainbow of colors in the sky above the bridge - red, orange, gold, green and blue. Fog on the water adds a little touch of magic to the serene scene. Very beautiful.</td>', 'Love the pale pastel hues and the feel of early morning in this composition. There is almost a rainbow of colors in the sky above the bridge - red, orange, gold, green and blue. Fog on the water adds a little touch of magic to the serene scene. Very beautiful.', '2012-03-16 08:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712251, 1003218, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very amusing title.<br/>I have no particular love myself for attack dogs and their owners , if that''s the concept :)<br/>UK is just flooded with both.</td>', 'Very amusing title.I have no particular love myself for attack dogs and their owners , if that''s the concept :)UK is just flooded with both.', '2012-03-16 08:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712256, 1004618, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice image.<br/>I have to admit I am wondering how it would look upside down, with the fountain as some kind of mysterious lamp hanging form the ceiling :)</td>', 'Nice image.I have to admit I am wondering how it would look upside down, with the fountain as some kind of mysterious lamp hanging form the ceiling :)', '2012-03-16 08:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712258, 1003627, 43463, '<td valign="top">Black and white tones are wonderful in this composition. Love the sense of movement in the photo. The flight of the pigeons is seen and ''felt'' with the swift strokes that sweep across the composition. The title - Vivaldi''s Four Seasons matches the swift lines and quick tempo of the flapping wings I see.</td>', 'Black and white tones are wonderful in this composition. Love the sense of movement in the photo. The flight of the pigeons is seen and ''felt'' with the swift strokes that sweep across the composition. The title - Vivaldi''s Four Seasons matches the swift lines and quick tempo of the flapping wings I see.', '2012-03-16 08:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712259, 1004019, 49018, '<td valign="top">It does look like a battlefield, perhaps a sea fight, if that was the idea.</td>', 'It does look like a battlefield, perhaps a sea fight, if that was the idea.', '2012-03-16 08:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712263, 1004244, 100831, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shot. Love the light - very well done!!!</td>', 'Beautifully shot. Love the light - very well done!!!', '2012-03-16 08:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712269, 1004490, 100831, '<td valign="top">There are so many interesting things going on here. Wonderful life story. 10</td>', 'There are so many interesting things going on here. Wonderful life story. 10', '2012-03-16 08:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712270, 1004535, 49018, '<td valign="top">Lovely model and dress. A very classic feel but for the processing and smoothing.<br/>Perhaps a bit excessive but it''s just my taste :)</td>', 'Lovely model and dress. A very classic feel but for the processing and smoothing.Perhaps a bit excessive but it''s just my taste :)', '2012-03-16 08:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712273, 1001961, 100831, '<td valign="top">Art at it''s best. JMRitz, you shine!</td>', 'Art at it''s best. JMRitz, you shine!', '2012-03-16 09:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712275, 1002736, 43463, '<td valign="top">My eyes follow the flow of green the undulates and ripples around the gazebo. Lines and shapes are very pleasing to the eye - it leads us to the main subject of the people and the gazebo. While the pink color of the woman''s jacket that stands out in the sea of green it is the maze of green that captures my attention. Just one small critique - the scene just seemed a touch ''washed out'' - just a little tweak to the shadows on Shadows/Midtones/Highlights brings in deeper shadows that adds more rich depth to the contrast and thus the colors as well. Still a great shot and well seen.</td>', 'My eyes follow the flow of green the undulates and ripples around the gazebo. Lines and shapes are very pleasing to the eye - it leads us to the main subject of the people and the gazebo. While the pink color of the woman''s jacket that stands out in the sea of green it is the maze of green that captures my attention. Just one small critique - the scene just seemed a touch ''washed out'' - just a little tweak to the shadows on Shadows/Midtones/Highlights brings in deeper shadows that adds more rich depth to the contrast and thus the colors as well. Still a great shot and well seen.', '2012-03-16 09:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712280, 1001915, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting, very curious t find out what this might be :)</td>', 'Interesting, very curious t find out what this might be :)', '2012-03-16 09:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712291, 1002270, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice, interesting view.<br/>Not a fan of this type of drawing like rendition, to be honest. It has an appeal but gets boring very quickly, at least with my images. But that''s just my taste.<br/>Many will just love it, hope it does well ;)</td>', 'Nice, interesting view.Not a fan of this type of drawing like rendition, to be honest. It has an appeal but gets boring very quickly, at least with my images. But that''s just my taste.Many will just love it, hope it does well ;)', '2012-03-16 09:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
