(6712814, 1002399, 98339, '<td valign="top">though this is very abstract...it doesn''t wow me in the subject matter...sometimes abstracts can really draw me in...this doesn''t mean others don''t like it (people)...it just means it doesn''t hit a chord with me...</td>', 'though this is very abstract...it doesn''t wow me in the subject matter...sometimes abstracts can really draw me in...this doesn''t mean others don''t like it (people)...it just means it doesn''t hit a chord with me...', '2012-03-16 16:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
