(6712818, 1004654, 98339, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would be like in B&amp;W???  I don''t think I would see this in a gallery/coffee shop...but I''ve been wrong before...</td>', 'I wonder what this would be like in B&W???  I don''t think I would see this in a gallery/coffee shop...but I''ve been wrong before...', '2012-03-16 16:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
