(6712822, 1002422, 29011, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and composition. For this shot I feel their expressions are key and it''s being masked by the light. Perhaps some slight selective dodging would''ve worked well? (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'Lovely lighting and composition. For this shot I feel their expressions are key and it''s being masked by the light. Perhaps some slight selective dodging would''ve worked well? (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-16 16:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
