(6712825, 1004654, 65319, '<td valign="top">Well, he looks more like he''s napping...I like how the windows reflect and open into the doorway of his/her dreams.</td>', 'Well, he looks more like he''s napping...I like how the windows reflect and open into the doorway of his/her dreams.', '2012-03-16 16:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712827, 1001906, 65319, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if he''s the witness or you are.  The greenish cast gives this image a wonderful alien flare.</td>', 'I can''t decide if he''s the witness or you are.  The greenish cast gives this image a wonderful alien flare.', '2012-03-16 16:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712829, 1004600, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of the moment. I like the repeating stripes in the image. Don''t mind the subjects'' faces being almost masked but wish there was just a tad more detail where their bodies touch for the arm wrap around? or are they just walking really close together? (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'Nice catch of the moment. I like the repeating stripes in the image. Don''t mind the subjects'' faces being almost masked but wish there was just a tad more detail where their bodies touch for the arm wrap around? or are they just walking really close together? (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-16 16:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712830, 1004427, 65319, '<td valign="top">The pink twist provides an anchor to an otherwise mundane and dreary world.</td>', 'The pink twist provides an anchor to an otherwise mundane and dreary world.', '2012-03-16 16:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712831, 1003952, 29011, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! cool rad color and contrast. (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'Fun shot! cool rad color and contrast. (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-16 16:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6712844, 1002911, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting shot to ponder. I like the overall elements of the shot. Do have a slight wish to see how it would''ve looked if it was a perfect profile POV shot of her body. Would''ve made for more graphic lines, but then the glass there would''ve been just even more of, where''s that coming from ;) (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'It''s an interesting shot to ponder. I like the overall elements of the shot. Do have a slight wish to see how it would''ve looked if it was a perfect profile POV shot of her body. Would''ve made for more graphic lines, but then the glass there would''ve been just even more of, where''s that coming from ;) (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-16 16:36:51.000000', NULL, 1);
