(6713052, 1004636, 134859, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo.  Love the color, the detail, looking through what appears to be a fishbowl.  The processing is well done.  Perfect artistic shot!  10</td>', 'Brilliant photo.  Love the color, the detail, looking through what appears to be a fishbowl.  The processing is well done.  Perfect artistic shot!  10', '2012-03-16 18:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713053, 1004641, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo!  Great angle and very fitting title.  Love the people, they look so small in comparison to the trees.  The clouds and sun/sky combination are beautiful!  Very well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo!  Great angle and very fitting title.  Love the people, they look so small in comparison to the trees.  The clouds and sun/sky combination are beautiful!  Very well done.', '2012-03-16 18:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713055, 1003981, 134859, '<td valign="top">Amazingly beautiful shot.  Reminds me of the New River Gorge Bridge.  I love the detail, the colors, the processing that was done.  10</td>', 'Amazingly beautiful shot.  Reminds me of the New River Gorge Bridge.  I love the detail, the colors, the processing that was done.  10', '2012-03-16 18:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713056, 1004614, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot.  Love the blue/purple colors.  The look on her face is good.  The skin looks so soft.  The bracelets, over the top, work well.  The position of her... it''s all very artistic!</td>', 'Very beautiful shot.  Love the blue/purple colors.  The look on her face is good.  The skin looks so soft.  The bracelets, over the top, work well.  The position of her... it''s all very artistic!', '2012-03-16 18:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713058, 1004570, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, timeless, classic photo.  This is what I think of, when I think about my future retirement.  I want to sit on the front porch, have some coffee, and enjoy the sunsets.  Wonderfully done.</td>', 'Beautiful, timeless, classic photo.  This is what I think of, when I think about my future retirement.  I want to sit on the front porch, have some coffee, and enjoy the sunsets.  Wonderfully done.', '2012-03-16 18:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713060, 1003786, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors... great detail.  Love the processing, the lighting, it all speaks art.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely colors... great detail.  Love the processing, the lighting, it all speaks art.  Very nicely done.', '2012-03-16 18:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713062, 1003952, 134859, '<td valign="top">It''s crazy the meaning this photo has to me.  I had a friend named Dorothy, who wore shoes just like this.  She also rode a Harley.  She was over the top in so many ways... definitely a wild woman... and this photo portrays her perfectly.  <br/>LOVE the colors, the detail, the only complaint is the pores on her legs... perhaps smoothing the skin would have made for a better photo.  <br/>Other than that... I absolutely love this shot.</td>', 'It''s crazy the meaning this photo has to me.  I had a friend named Dorothy, who wore shoes just like this.  She also rode a Harley.  She was over the top in so many ways... definitely a wild woman... and this photo portrays her perfectly.  LOVE the colors, the detail, the only complaint is the pores on her legs... perhaps smoothing the skin would have made for a better photo.  Other than that... I absolutely love this shot.', '2012-03-16 18:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713068, 1001932, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot.  Love the color conversion.  The detail is perfectly executed.  I would definitely hang this on my wall.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot.  Love the color conversion.  The detail is perfectly executed.  I would definitely hang this on my wall.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-16 18:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713069, 1003734, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Love the curves and lines.  The color is amazing.  Perfectly shot and processed.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Love the curves and lines.  The color is amazing.  Perfectly shot and processed.', '2012-03-16 18:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713070, 1004500, 134859, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail and vibrant colors!  Love this close up/macro!  Very well done.  Don''t see any flaws whatsoever.</td>', 'Amazing detail and vibrant colors!  Love this close up/macro!  Very well done.  Don''t see any flaws whatsoever.', '2012-03-16 18:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713076, 1004568, 134859, '<td valign="top">Grungy, dirty, creepy, eerie... and absolutely amazingly beautiful!  Love the guy standing way off in the back!  Great touch.</td>', 'Grungy, dirty, creepy, eerie... and absolutely amazingly beautiful!  Love the guy standing way off in the back!  Great touch.', '2012-03-16 19:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713077, 1003873, 134859, '<td valign="top">The title says it all.  <br/>Beautiful landscape. <br/>Love the detail of the foreground.  The sunset in the back is gorgeous.  The reflections are lovely.  Great shot!</td>', 'The title says it all.  Beautiful landscape. Love the detail of the foreground.  The sunset in the back is gorgeous.  The reflections are lovely.  Great shot!', '2012-03-16 19:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713078, 1003996, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the "classic" feel of this shot.  Lovely photo, beautiful color.  Nice detail.  Very well done.</td>', 'Love the "classic" feel of this shot.  Lovely photo, beautiful color.  Nice detail.  Very well done.', '2012-03-16 19:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713079, 1001917, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot.  Love the motion and stillness of the photo.  The black and white color conversion is a perfect choice. The detail on the tower and castle (?) is impeccable.  No flaws that I notice.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot.  Love the motion and stillness of the photo.  The black and white color conversion is a perfect choice. The detail on the tower and castle (?) is impeccable.  No flaws that I notice.', '2012-03-16 19:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
