(6713081, 1004655, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors!  LOVE the blues, purples, and pinks.  The city line way off in the background is a beautiful touch.  Amazing shot!  Well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors!  LOVE the blues, purples, and pinks.  The city line way off in the background is a beautiful touch.  Amazing shot!  Well done.', '2012-03-16 19:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713083, 1003047, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful atmospheric image. One small suggestion: clean up those spots on on the right edge.</td>', 'Very beautiful atmospheric image. One small suggestion: clean up those spots on on the right edge.', '2012-03-16 19:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713106, 1001904, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Love the bright whites.  The picture has a story behind it.  I can only imagine.  <br/>Very nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely shot. Love the bright whites.  The picture has a story behind it.  I can only imagine.  Very nicely done.', '2012-03-16 19:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713108, 1004403, 134859, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  It speaks of power, of authority, of determination.  The detail is good.  The lighting is spot on.  Love the clean black background and clothing.  Wonderfully executed!</td>', 'I love this shot.  It speaks of power, of authority, of determination.  The detail is good.  The lighting is spot on.  Love the clean black background and clothing.  Wonderfully executed!', '2012-03-16 19:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713109, 1002194, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Great detail.  Nice PP.  I could imagine the stories this old man could tell... "well, back in my day..."  It would be interesting to sit next to him on the bus/train and just reminisce about the olden days.</td>', 'Love it.  Great detail.  Nice PP.  I could imagine the stories this old man could tell... "well, back in my day..."  It would be interesting to sit next to him on the bus/train and just reminisce about the olden days.', '2012-03-16 19:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713111, 1002953, 134859, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot.  Seems a little basic (color wise).  But that''s not a bad thing.  It just goes to show the viewer the beauty that is seen with the naked eye.  Nice composition (though I think I would have included the entire boat, and not cut off the bottom).  But very serene shot.</td>', 'Pretty shot.  Seems a little basic (color wise).  But that''s not a bad thing.  It just goes to show the viewer the beauty that is seen with the naked eye.  Nice composition (though I think I would have included the entire boat, and not cut off the bottom).  But very serene shot.', '2012-03-16 19:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713123, 1002553, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the detail, the color... the darkness and the man behind the window.  it''s almost as if he has something to say, yet is being held back from saying it.  Great shot!!!</td>', 'Love the detail, the color... the darkness and the man behind the window.  it''s almost as if he has something to say, yet is being held back from saying it.  Great shot!!!', '2012-03-16 19:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
