(6713125, 1004588, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail.  Love the color conversion.  The different lines, shapes, details... it all makes this photo even more interesting.  The water also adds that certain something.  Great shot!</td>', 'Beautiful detail.  Love the color conversion.  The different lines, shapes, details... it all makes this photo even more interesting.  The water also adds that certain something.  Great shot!', '2012-03-16 19:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
