(6713959, 1002058, 86799, '<td valign="top">Ooh, baby baby it''s a wild world...and it''s hard to get by, just upon a smile...<br/>This one made me stop.  The expression of "trepidation" maybe, facing the light, unprotected...beautiful, but so vulnerable.  <br/>Marvelous.  This is a winner to me.  Gotta bump it.  Thanks.</td>', 'Ooh, baby baby it''s a wild world...and it''s hard to get by, just upon a smile...This one made me stop.  The expression of "trepidation" maybe, facing the light, unprotected...beautiful, but so vulnerable.  Marvelous.  This is a winner to me.  Gotta bump it.  Thanks.', '2012-03-17 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
