(6713965, 1003346, 86799, '<td valign="top">So much to see and enjoy, lots of action, depth, emotion.  Outstanding.  Not a fan of his right hand position, but some elements have to be accepted as presented.</td>', 'So much to see and enjoy, lots of action, depth, emotion.  Outstanding.  Not a fan of his right hand position, but some elements have to be accepted as presented.', '2012-03-17 09:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
