(6714142, 1002553, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Love the mood here. A man behind an iron bound window - perfectly willing to look out at the world but not willing to let anyone in. He remains behind his iron ''shelter'' in comfort of his solitude. Great textures on the peeling paint and shapes of the iron scrollwork - the age seen here adds to the mood by playing into the idea that over time he has grown comfortable with being alone.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Love the mood here. A man behind an iron bound window - perfectly willing to look out at the world but not willing to let anyone in. He remains behind his iron ''shelter'' in comfort of his solitude. Great textures on the peeling paint and shapes of the iron scrollwork - the age seen here adds to the mood by playing into the idea that over time he has grown comfortable with being alone.', '2012-03-17 11:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
