(6714726, 1004663, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Love the B&amp;W tones and the ''texture'' I see in this floral still life. Great details and the curvature of the tulips in the vase is very pleasing to the eye. The vignette helps draw the eye towards the main subject in this art piece. Very lovely and well composed.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Love the B&W tones and the ''texture'' I see in this floral still life. Great details and the curvature of the tulips in the vase is very pleasing to the eye. The vignette helps draw the eye towards the main subject in this art piece. Very lovely and well composed.', '2012-03-17 21:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714727, 1004663, 38162, '<td valign="top">either too much structure or too much sharpening.  terrific composition!   terrific tonality.  I love this concept.  10 ends up an 8.  gl!</td>', 'either too much structure or too much sharpening.  terrific composition!   terrific tonality.  I love this concept.  10 ends up an 8.  gl!', '2012-03-17 21:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714729, 1002953, 38162, '<td valign="top">indeed a muskoka fond memory.  just needs some break from literal.  loosen up!  gl.</td>', 'indeed a muskoka fond memory.  just needs some break from literal.  loosen up!  gl.', '2012-03-17 21:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714731, 1002222, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>What makes this visually appealing in the shapes and lines the ebb and flow as you so call attention to in the title. There is a strong sense of floating as we see the tiny tenticles dance and flow in the water. My only critique is that it could use a bit more contrast to deepen the shadows such that the midtones and highlights of the jellyfish pops more off the backdrop.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. What makes this visually appealing in the shapes and lines the ebb and flow as you so call attention to in the title. There is a strong sense of floating as we see the tiny tenticles dance and flow in the water. My only critique is that it could use a bit more contrast to deepen the shadows such that the midtones and highlights of the jellyfish pops more off the backdrop.', '2012-03-17 21:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6714732, 1003260, 38162, '<td valign="top">actor or sausage king - make up my mind!  but seriously folks ... I love the risk you took here but this is pretty blown out in spots eh?   6.  gl</td>', 'actor or sausage king - make up my mind!  but seriously folks ... I love the risk you took here but this is pretty blown out in spots eh?   6.  gl', '2012-03-17 21:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
