(6714736, 1004532, 117717, '<td valign="top">Love it!  The graphic contrast, composition &amp; light are amazing.  Maybe the top could be cropped just a bit. I just want to keep looking at this image!</td>', 'Love it!  The graphic contrast, composition & light are amazing.  Maybe the top could be cropped just a bit. I just want to keep looking at this image!', '2012-03-17 21:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
