(6715572, 1002090, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fascinating!  Was that all you running around, or are the blurs just regular people going about their business?  I wonder why people went both directions on the stairs, but didn''t use of the escalators?  So many good stories and a wonderful cloudy effect.  Well done!</td>', 'Fascinating!  Was that all you running around, or are the blurs just regular people going about their business?  I wonder why people went both directions on the stairs, but didn''t use of the escalators?  So many good stories and a wonderful cloudy effect.  Well done!', '2012-03-18 23:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
