(6717658, 1003617, 86799, '<td valign="top">This is very cool - the only thing that trows it off a little for me is the missing right hind foot - I now it''s there, but where is it?  LOL.  Great shot, though.</td>', 'This is very cool - the only thing that trows it off a little for me is the missing right hind foot - I now it''s there, but where is it?  LOL.  Great shot, though.', '2012-03-20 17:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
