(6717669, 1002135, 29011, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely. Definitely has a fairytale feel to it. Magical shot. (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'Quite lovely. Definitely has a fairytale feel to it. Magical shot. (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-20 17:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717671, 1003422, 29011, '<td valign="top">The sentiment is quite lovely but I''m a on the fence on if the pastel like effect does anything. The natural light and props seem to have lots of promise. Perhaps worth re-visiting/re-editing? saying that there is still something to be said for your vision. So if it''s set. I appreciate the different view and it does seem to be growing on me the more I look at the shot.(just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'The sentiment is quite lovely but I''m a on the fence on if the pastel like effect does anything. The natural light and props seem to have lots of promise. Perhaps worth re-visiting/re-editing? saying that there is still something to be said for your vision. So if it''s set. I appreciate the different view and it does seem to be growing on me the more I look at the shot.(just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-20 17:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717674, 1001922, 29011, '<td valign="top">Visually this might be my favorite. The shot has a magical quality. The warm tones here I''m a sucker for ;)<br/> <br/>"Whisper your secrets" might''ve been enough though. Putting the word skin in there makes me concentrate on the texture of the skin more and how it appears a tad overly smoothed. Still all in all, it''s very nicely composed and exposed for. (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'Visually this might be my favorite. The shot has a magical quality. The warm tones here I''m a sucker for ;) "Whisper your secrets" might''ve been enough though. Putting the word skin in there makes me concentrate on the texture of the skin more and how it appears a tad overly smoothed. Still all in all, it''s very nicely composed and exposed for. (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-20 17:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717675, 1004471, 29011, '<td valign="top">The symmetry is grand as are the range of tones, from white to black.<br/>(just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'The symmetry is grand as are the range of tones, from white to black.(just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-20 17:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717676, 1002843, 29011, '<td valign="top">A beautiful and strong image. The message is clear. A strong pose with the lines created by the veil are one of my favorite aspects of this image. (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'A beautiful and strong image. The message is clear. A strong pose with the lines created by the veil are one of my favorite aspects of this image. (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-20 17:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717686, 1003840, 29011, '<td valign="top">The colors and smooth lines...The shot is very visually appealing to me. I like it! Wouldn''t change a thing of the shot itself. I''m not one to put too much emphasis on titles but the title here perhaps doesn''t add much and breaks the fluidity of the viewers thought if they read it before taking the shot in. Give them some mystery here ;) since it''s not guess the object, we do cleary see it''s a bike. I understand sometimes people also want a deeper meaning attached to a visual but trying too hard also comes across so untitled works too at times. Whisked Away comes to mind here. A fluid title to match this fluid shot. Cheers! (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'The colors and smooth lines...The shot is very visually appealing to me. I like it! Wouldn''t change a thing of the shot itself. I''m not one to put too much emphasis on titles but the title here perhaps doesn''t add much and breaks the fluidity of the viewers thought if they read it before taking the shot in. Give them some mystery here ;) since it''s not guess the object, we do cleary see it''s a bike. I understand sometimes people also want a deeper meaning attached to a visual but trying too hard also comes across so untitled works too at times. Whisked Away comes to mind here. A fluid title to match this fluid shot. Cheers! (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-20 18:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717700, 1004546, 112972, '<td valign="top">My choice for the blue.  Amazing work!</td>', 'My choice for the blue.  Amazing work!', '2012-03-20 18:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717721, 1004159, 7327, '<td valign="top">Tricky lighting, nice starburst on cross but the Mission(?) needs some work to brighten it up a little. Nice composition.</td>', 'Tricky lighting, nice starburst on cross but the Mission(?) needs some work to brighten it up a little. Nice composition.', '2012-03-20 19:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717723, 1002072, 7327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the flower and,if I read your title correctly, the darkness is part of the dream. But I would have liked a little more detail in the flower.</td>', 'Nice shot of the flower and,if I read your title correctly, the darkness is part of the dream. But I would have liked a little more detail in the flower.', '2012-03-20 19:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717724, 1004576, 7327, '<td valign="top">Almost abstract, nice closeup ,framing, and lighting.</td>', 'Almost abstract, nice closeup ,framing, and lighting.', '2012-03-20 19:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
