(6717930, 1004654, 29011, '<td valign="top">Visually, I really like this shot. Conceptually it also works really well. I get the reflections work as headstones. The connection with the title does make this a shot to look at and ponder about more than average. Though I cant help wonder if there could be a more cheerful approach as the dog is quite cute :) (just commenting, no vote)</td>', 'Visually, I really like this shot. Conceptually it also works really well. I get the reflections work as headstones. The connection with the title does make this a shot to look at and ponder about more than average. Though I cant help wonder if there could be a more cheerful approach as the dog is quite cute :) (just commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-20 22:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6717961, 1001980, 29011, '<td valign="top">Reminds me so much of a goldfish''s tail. A very clever abstract looking image. (only commenting, no vote)</td>', 'Reminds me so much of a goldfish''s tail. A very clever abstract looking image. (only commenting, no vote)', '2012-03-20 22:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
