sure you won''t mind the comparison.<br/> <br/>This is flat out fantastic. I particularly like how the thumbnail looks like a washing machine.<br/> <br/>One of my 10s</td>', ' ubique or  nixter?  ubique or  nixter? Or perhaps  RKT... I go for  nixter - if not, then I''m sure you won''t mind the comparison. This is flat out fantastic. I particularly like how the thumbnail looks like a washing machine. One of my 10s', '2012-03-21 18:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719217, 1004202, 100393, '<td valign="top">One of my 10s - reasons why I like this:<br/> <br/>Bold framing, great  coloration, persuasive back story and lovely light.</td>', 'One of my 10s - reasons why I like this: Bold framing, great  coloration, persuasive back story and lovely light.', '2012-03-21 18:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719218, 1003657, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great piece of art.</td>', 'Great piece of art.', '2012-03-21 18:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719219, 1004627, 100393, '<td valign="top">One of my 10s - reasons why I like this:<br/> <br/>Great sense of depth, the reflected window light looks like reflected water and that shaft of light on the left is fantastic.</td>', 'One of my 10s - reasons why I like this: Great sense of depth, the reflected window light looks like reflected water and that shaft of light on the left is fantastic.', '2012-03-21 18:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719221, 1002524, 100393, '<td valign="top">One of my 10s - reasons why I like this:<br/> <br/>Stand out coloration and processing, a wonderful country scene and the figure - tremendous.</td>', 'One of my 10s - reasons why I like this: Stand out coloration and processing, a wonderful country scene and the figure - tremendous.', '2012-03-21 18:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719224, 1004546, 100393, '<td valign="top">One of my 10s - reasons why I like this:<br/> <br/>Fantastic everything! Great perspective, lovely light and a tremendous scene. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=36606" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Alexsaberi</a>?</td>', 'One of my 10s - reasons why I like this: Fantastic everything! Great perspective, lovely light and a tremendous scene.  Alexsaberi?', '2012-03-21 18:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719226, 1004663, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image! Great composition and I love the way you''ve processed it.</td>', 'Beautiful image! Great composition and I love the way you''ve processed it.', '2012-03-21 18:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719241, 1001917, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Great B&amp;W tones in this photo!!! Love the ghostly people milling about and the zoom lines from passing cars. Those two elements make it look like the Palace of Westminster and Big Ben remain constant; never changing in the face of time. Time zooms on by and people come and go, but this landmark will stand.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Great B&W tones in this photo!!! Love the ghostly people milling about and the zoom lines from passing cars. Those two elements make it look like the Palace of Westminster and Big Ben remain constant; never changing in the face of time. Time zooms on by and people come and go, but this landmark will stand.', '2012-03-21 19:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719251, 1004236, 100393, '<td valign="top">One of my 10s - reasons why I like this:<br/> <br/>A pure vision realised. Some may say the figure spoils the image - not me, it removes it from notions of contrived abstraction to something more tangible. We feel wonder at the (real) world as a result.</td>', 'One of my 10s - reasons why I like this: A pure vision realised. Some may say the figure spoils the image - not me, it removes it from notions of contrived abstraction to something more tangible. We feel wonder at the (real) world as a result.', '2012-03-21 19:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719255, 1001956, 100393, '<td valign="top">One of my 10s - reasons why I like this:<br/> <br/>Bold, straight up, no nonsense. A shared moment, but not one we would necessarily want to share. We are intruding.<br/> <br/>Superbly made.</td>', 'One of my 10s - reasons why I like this: Bold, straight up, no nonsense. A shared moment, but not one we would necessarily want to share. We are intruding. Superbly made.', '2012-03-21 19:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719256, 1004557, 100393, '<td valign="top">One of my 10s - reasons why I like this:<br/> <br/>Beautifully made. Stunning colours, compelling long shadows but most of all the lack of sky. Amazing.</td>', 'One of my 10s - reasons why I like this: Beautifully made. Stunning colours, compelling long shadows but most of all the lack of sky. Amazing.', '2012-03-21 19:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719259, 1002269, 100393, '<td valign="top">One of my 10s - reasons why I like this:<br/> <br/>Right up my street, eclectic POV, shadowy figures, lovely blur, great sense of mystery. That row of figures at the top are fascinating and menacing in equal measure.<br/> <br/>Another potential <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nixter</a> shot.</td>', 'One of my 10s - reasons why I like this: Right up my street, eclectic POV, shadowy figures, lovely blur, great sense of mystery. That row of figures at the top are fascinating and menacing in equal measure. Another potential  nixter shot.', '2012-03-21 19:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719301, 1004599, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstract image.</td>', 'Very cool abstract image.', '2012-03-21 20:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719305, 1004565, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this shot.  The lighting and details are quite good.  I do wish the background had some "pop" to it.  This would be super cool in front of a blue sky with puffy white clouds.  :-)  Something, anything besides the plain grey / off-white.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this shot.  The lighting and details are quite good.  I do wish the background had some "pop" to it.  This would be super cool in front of a blue sky with puffy white clouds.  :-)  Something, anything besides the plain grey / off-white.', '2012-03-21 20:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719306, 1001961, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good job, expressive. Well portrayed disapproval (of the ale?) :)</td>', 'Good job, expressive. Well portrayed disapproval (of the ale?) :)', '2012-03-21 20:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719309, 1004152, 57447, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2012-03-21 20:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719331, 1003627, 94815, '<td valign="top">I would have called this "survival" as a analogy of contemporary life struggling against the winds of out of control financial institutions and congress.</td>', 'I would have called this "survival" as a analogy of contemporary life struggling against the winds of out of control financial institutions and congress.', '2012-03-21 21:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719333, 1002269, 94815, '<td valign="top">Intense - Poe like. A prelude to the "Pit and the Pendulum". Dramatic and top five.</td>', 'Intense - Poe like. A prelude to the "Pit and the Pendulum". Dramatic and top five.', '2012-03-21 21:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719336, 1003346, 94815, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderfully spontaneous Henri Cartier-Bresson look. I give this my top pick.</td>', 'Such a wonderfully spontaneous Henri Cartier-Bresson look. I give this my top pick.', '2012-03-21 21:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719339, 1004439, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very good rendering of elemental tones. Nice processing.</td>', 'Very good rendering of elemental tones. Nice processing.', '2012-03-21 21:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719341, 1004578, 94815, '<td valign="top">I live to capture shots like this but rarely (read never) do. Beautiful spontaneous rythms and movement around the central subject.</td>', 'I live to capture shots like this but rarely (read never) do. Beautiful spontaneous rythms and movement around the central subject.', '2012-03-21 21:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719346, 1004166, 94815, '<td valign="top">This processing distills the image into its in elemental emotions. Memorable. Now about those bars... ? I give it an 8 anyway.</td>', 'This processing distills the image into its in elemental emotions. Memorable. Now about those bars... ? I give it an 8 anyway.', '2012-03-21 21:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719349, 1004546, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautifully toned street image full of strong content. It gets a 9 from me in spite of the bars that seriously trivialize the othewise powerful visual impression. It could have been a 10.</td>', 'Beautifully toned street image full of strong content. It gets a 9 from me in spite of the bars that seriously trivialize the othewise powerful visual impression. It could have been a 10.', '2012-03-21 21:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719351, 1004577, 94815, '<td valign="top">What do we see and how do we see it.. a flash of golden curls might be the only thing that could distract from a face like that? Yes. Well done. 8</td>', 'What do we see and how do we see it.. a flash of golden curls might be the only thing that could distract from a face like that? Yes. Well done. 8', '2012-03-21 21:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719360, 1003617, 94815, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly captured musculature of the horse. You have Picasso''s eye. 8</td>', 'Brilliantly captured musculature of the horse. You have Picasso''s eye. 8', '2012-03-21 22:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719373, 1004532, 94815, '<td valign="top">Powerful portrait made strong by setting the face off against the bleached white. 7</td>', 'Powerful portrait made strong by setting the face off against the bleached white. 7', '2012-03-21 22:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719376, 1004643, 94815, '<td valign="top">Not easy - well managed tones and perfect comp. Le Daumier Rousseau''s colors come to mind. I''m a sucker for frame filling detail and this does that better than I''ve seen on dpc in years. I''m giving it an 9 because it keeps drawing me in on repeated viewings as any good art should do. Naa. Bump to a 10.</td>', 'Not easy - well managed tones and perfect comp. Le Daumier Rousseau''s colors come to mind. I''m a sucker for frame filling detail and this does that better than I''ve seen on dpc in years. I''m giving it an 9 because it keeps drawing me in on repeated viewings as any good art should do. Naa. Bump to a 10.', '2012-03-21 22:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719380, 1002632, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of an illusive mood amplified by the background full range of tones. 7</td>', 'Beautiful capture of an illusive mood amplified by the background full range of tones. 7', '2012-03-21 22:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719383, 1004490, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good capture of a spontaneous moment although the connection to Christmas is missing. On the other hand, the earthy colors gives the image an elemental feeling that transcends the season or holiday. That makes it art.</td>', 'Good capture of a spontaneous moment although the connection to Christmas is missing. On the other hand, the earthy colors gives the image an elemental feeling that transcends the season or holiday. That makes it art.', '2012-03-21 22:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719384, 1001916, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of a visually tickling image. Something we can dwell on and come back to. Can''t ask for more.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of a visually tickling image. Something we can dwell on and come back to. Can''t ask for more.', '2012-03-21 22:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719387, 1002926, 94815, '<td valign="top">Elemental rendering of human aspiration for better or worse. Powerful image where the vignetting actually works. 7</td>', 'Elemental rendering of human aspiration for better or worse. Powerful image where the vignetting actually works. 7', '2012-03-21 22:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719390, 1004380, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very strong rendering of human connections. Such a rare capture and wonderful to view again and again. 7</td>', 'Very strong rendering of human connections. Such a rare capture and wonderful to view again and again. 7', '2012-03-21 22:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719393, 1004483, 94815, '<td valign="top">To my eye, a strong rendering of the alienation of man from his aspirations or maybe his environment. Or maybe just a sad-eyed portrait. The multiple levels of appreciation makes it art. 7</td>', 'To my eye, a strong rendering of the alienation of man from his aspirations or maybe his environment. Or maybe just a sad-eyed portrait. The multiple levels of appreciation makes it art. 7', '2012-03-21 22:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719395, 1002911, 94265, '<td valign="top">I wish the glass wasn''t there, personally. I feel it transforms a nicely-lit, well-detailed bodyscape into something comical and silly; a glass stem in the arse doesn''t feel artistic to me. Totally spoils it for me. Otherwise, a very nice image.</td>', 'I wish the glass wasn''t there, personally. I feel it transforms a nicely-lit, well-detailed bodyscape into something comical and silly; a glass stem in the arse doesn''t feel artistic to me. Totally spoils it for me. Otherwise, a very nice image.', '2012-03-21 22:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719397, 1004633, 94815, '<td valign="top">Such lovely nostalgic tones make this irresistable. Oh it has other commendable attributes, like comp, but I haven''t time to list them all. Easy 7.</td>', 'Such lovely nostalgic tones make this irresistable. Oh it has other commendable attributes, like comp, but I haven''t time to list them all. Easy 7.', '2012-03-21 22:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719398, 1002090, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture, it''s like a thick swarm of ghosts, I actually thought there was a train station fire when I saw the thumbnail. Coolness.</td>', 'Very interesting capture, it''s like a thick swarm of ghosts, I actually thought there was a train station fire when I saw the thumbnail. Coolness.', '2012-03-21 22:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719402, 1001906, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good portrait. 6</td>', 'Good portrait. 6', '2012-03-21 22:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719403, 1004569, 94815, '<td valign="top">Elemental landscape. 6</td>', 'Elemental landscape. 6', '2012-03-21 22:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719406, 1002524, 94815, '<td valign="top">Stark landscape interpreting Andrew Wyeth''s "Christina''s World". 6</td>', 'Stark landscape interpreting Andrew Wyeth''s "Christina''s World". 6', '2012-03-21 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719407, 1003218, 94815, '<td valign="top">Humor in "Art". You betcha. 7</td>', 'Humor in "Art". You betcha. 7', '2012-03-21 22:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719409, 1001956, 94815, '<td valign="top">Noirish concept - once removed. 6</td>', 'Noirish concept - once removed. 6', '2012-03-21 22:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719410, 1004152, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nearly surreal tones give the image a memorable quality. I love the compositional balance between the S-curved road and teh vertical trees. 7</td>', 'Nearly surreal tones give the image a memorable quality. I love the compositional balance between the S-curved road and teh vertical trees. 7', '2012-03-21 22:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719412, 1004272, 94815, '<td valign="top">Specialized capture of a rarely experienced view - sunrise from a night on the water. In my case on my father''s 26 ft sailboat off the coast of New Jersey in 1976. 6</td>', 'Specialized capture of a rarely experienced view - sunrise from a night on the water. In my case on my father''s 26 ft sailboat off the coast of New Jersey in 1976. 6', '2012-03-21 22:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719414, 1002630, 94815, '<td valign="top">Bleached and stark. Texas, 2012?</td>', 'Bleached and stark. Texas, 2012?', '2012-03-21 22:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719416, 1004154, 94815, '<td valign="top">Effectively compressed action. 6</td>', 'Effectively compressed action. 6', '2012-03-21 22:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719417, 1003279, 94815, '<td valign="top">Gritty struggle - daily repetition. Such is life.</td>', 'Gritty struggle - daily repetition. Such is life.', '2012-03-21 22:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719451, 1004546, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shot.  So deep and symbolic too.  Excellent!</td>', 'Beautifully shot.  So deep and symbolic too.  Excellent!', '2012-03-21 23:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719452, 1004626, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is great.  Love the 3D effect.  Beautiful capture of color!</td>', 'This is great.  Love the 3D effect.  Beautiful capture of color!', '2012-03-21 23:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719456, 1002553, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos where you could create 100 different stories from it.  With his face being hiddent behind the metal, it makes me wonder if he''s happy, sad, or just found something that piqued his curiousity.</td>', 'This is one of those photos where you could create 100 different stories from it.  With his face being hiddent behind the metal, it makes me wonder if he''s happy, sad, or just found something that piqued his curiousity.', '2012-03-21 23:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719459, 1001922, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  The colortone makes me think of a story.  I could see this with one of those inspirational quotes attached to it.</td>', 'I love this one.  The colortone makes me think of a story.  I could see this with one of those inspirational quotes attached to it.', '2012-03-21 23:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719461, 1002604, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is definitely artsy.  The blur makes me wonder more about what is happening in the moment.</td>', 'This is definitely artsy.  The blur makes me wonder more about what is happening in the moment.', '2012-03-21 23:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719463, 1004577, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like how the focus is in the most unexpected place.  Her movement helps build the moment of anticipation.</td>', 'I like how the focus is in the most unexpected place.  Her movement helps build the moment of anticipation.', '2012-03-21 23:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719465, 1003627, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love all the excitement and blur.  Makes me wonder what is happening behind the streaks.</td>', 'Love all the excitement and blur.  Makes me wonder what is happening behind the streaks.', '2012-03-21 23:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719469, 1004654, 67697, '<td valign="top">So what compelled you to capture this moment?  Good eye to see the dog supporting the line between the light and shadows.</td>', 'So what compelled you to capture this moment?  Good eye to see the dog supporting the line between the light and shadows.', '2012-03-21 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719471, 1004419, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the classic feel to this one.  Makes me think of film photography.</td>', 'I like the classic feel to this one.  Makes me think of film photography.', '2012-03-21 23:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719474, 1003346, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the natural energy here.  There''s nothing better than unscripted joy.</td>', 'I love the natural energy here.  There''s nothing better than unscripted joy.', '2012-03-21 23:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719476, 1004355, 138630, '<td valign="top">Obvious interest or, I prefer to think, affection.  Lovely focus and moment.  8</td>', 'Obvious interest or, I prefer to think, affection.  Lovely focus and moment.  8', '2012-03-21 23:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719482, 1004614, 138630, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of the ballustrade here - I especially like the arm and hand position of the right arm.  Great color contrast.  Lovely and unusual portrait.  8</td>', 'Wonderful use of the ballustrade here - I especially like the arm and hand position of the right arm.  Great color contrast.  Lovely and unusual portrait.  8', '2012-03-21 23:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719483, 1002430, 67697, '<td valign="top">So amazing how well the horizon blended in.  What a fantastic capture!</td>', 'So amazing how well the horizon blended in.  What a fantastic capture!', '2012-03-21 23:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719486, 1004152, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the rich warm  woodsy tones, the line of the road, the Orton like processing.  Very pretty.  Wish there was something of interest on the road :) 8</td>', 'I like the rich warm  woodsy tones, the line of the road, the Orton like processing.  Very pretty.  Wish there was something of interest on the road :) 8', '2012-03-21 23:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6719487, 1002676, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a fascinating blend.  Love the mystery!</td>', 'What a fascinating blend.  Love the mystery!', '2012-03-21 23:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
