(6719734, 1004061, 31456, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot. Congrats on the high ranking.<br/> <br/>PS: You were in New Hope? Gahhh should''ve told me.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot. Congrats on the high ranking. PS: You were in New Hope? Gahhh should''ve told me.', '2012-03-22 01:58:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719737, 1002667, 108580, '<td valign="top">Very good "Close-Up" of an extremely large spider with a "non-macro" lens. Great use of your gear. Super colour and sharpness, perfect DOF and Copo. Well Done 7. On the "art" front I''m not so convinced though, Mother Nature would beg to differ though.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-22 02:28:38.</i></td>', 'Very good "Close-Up" of an extremely large spider with a "non-macro" lens. Great use of your gear. Super colour and sharpness, perfect DOF and Copo. Well Done 7. On the "art" front I''m not so convinced though, Mother Nature would beg to differ though.', '2012-03-22 02:02:28.000000', '2012-03-22 02:28:38.000000', 0),
(6719738, 1004565, 40391, '<td valign="top">I quite liked this shot, especially the coloured pegs to go with the colourful and interesting shoes.  Your title did make me laugh too.</td>', 'I quite liked this shot, especially the coloured pegs to go with the colourful and interesting shoes.  Your title did make me laugh too.', '2012-03-22 02:02:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719739, 1002677, 108580, '<td valign="top">Super and DMC. Looks very much like a hood ornament and the art of cars is undisputed...except maybe at DPC.<br/>Under-appreciated. I''m your 10.</td>', 'Super and DMC. Looks very much like a hood ornament and the art of cars is undisputed...except maybe at DPC.Under-appreciated. I''m your 10.', '2012-03-22 02:04:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719742, 1002566, 135744, '<td valign="top">Oh dear! A very bad choice of photo by the looks of things.</td>', 'Oh dear! A very bad choice of photo by the looks of things.', '2012-03-22 02:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719745, 1002843, 113591, '<td valign="top">Uplifting. Thanks. Perfect PP. Dreamy effect works so well.</td>', 'Uplifting. Thanks. Perfect PP. Dreamy effect works so well.', '2012-03-22 02:11:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719746, 1004557, 113591, '<td valign="top">Well done Konrad. Brilliant viewpoint, perfect timing, with those shadows.</td>', 'Well done Konrad. Brilliant viewpoint, perfect timing, with those shadows.', '2012-03-22 02:14:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719747, 1002177, 108580, '<td valign="top">A lot of my own landscape and wild photography has a personal connection. I saw this for what it was and what I experienced of Australia. Your image touched me because I''ve been to places like Ayers rock, which I have climbed, and the surrounding ranges. We have an (Jack) <a href="//www.jackabsalom.com.au/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Absalom</a> bought in ''82/''83 and much of his work is in the same style. In order to make the image feel a tad more isolated and barren, I''d leave a bit of space (sky) on the right hand side between the last boulder and the edge of the frame if it''s in your original.<br/>7.</td>', 'A lot of my own landscape and wild photography has a personal connection. I saw this for what it was and what I experienced of Australia. Your image touched me because I''ve been to places like Ayers rock, which I have climbed, and the surrounding ranges. We have an (Jack) Absalom bought in ''82/''83 and much of his work is in the same style. In order to make the image feel a tad more isolated and barren, I''d leave a bit of space (sky) on the right hand side between the last boulder and the edge of the frame if it''s in your original.7.', '2012-03-22 02:16:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719749, 1002371, 100393, '<td valign="top">Ah Ben - I''m frustrated not to have included you in my list!<br/> <br/>Lovely stuff!</td>', 'Ah Ben - I''m frustrated not to have included you in my list! Lovely stuff!', '2012-03-22 02:19:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719750, 1004546, 89223, '<td valign="top">Love this photo! esp. in the b/w Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Love this photo! esp. in the b/w Congrats on the ribbon!', '2012-03-22 02:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719751, 1004546, 89223, '<td valign="top">Love this photo! esp. in the b/w Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Love this photo! esp. in the b/w Congrats on the ribbon!', '2012-03-22 02:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719752, 1002000, 28742, '<td valign="top">I was initially puzzled by the blue until I realized it was the sky. I think this would have done better with the sky completely blocked out or with a gray sky. It''s just too blotchy and distracting as is. Otherwise, Richard, this is a beautiful image. Just giving you my take on what I, and possibly other voters, saw.</td>', 'I was initially puzzled by the blue until I realized it was the sky. I think this would have done better with the sky completely blocked out or with a gray sky. It''s just too blotchy and distracting as is. Otherwise, Richard, this is a beautiful image. Just giving you my take on what I, and possibly other voters, saw.', '2012-03-22 02:22:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719754, 1004403, 28742, '<td valign="top">You''ll poke your eye out, kid! :P</td>', 'You''ll poke your eye out, kid! :P', '2012-03-22 02:24:16.000000', NULL, 0),
