(6719842, 1002194, 16148, '<td valign="top">I thought this would have done better.  One commenter said it might be better in b&amp;w.  I thought the color was fine but looking again she might be right.  Some wonderful lines and textures that would work well in b&amp;w.  Either way, I like it.</td>', 'I thought this would have done better.  One commenter said it might be better in b&w.  I thought the color was fine but looking again she might be right.  Some wonderful lines and textures that would work well in b&w.  Either way, I like it.', '2012-03-22 08:00:03.000000', NULL, 0),
