(6719870, 1002000, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> I was initially puzzled by the blue until I realized it was the sky. I think this would have done better with the sky completely blocked out or with a gray sky. It''s just too blotchy and distracting as is. Otherwise, Richard, this is a beautiful image. Just giving you my take on what I, and possibly other voters, saw. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks, Art.  I appreciate your comments.  The Colorado sky does confuse people, especially when viewed through the leaves of an aspen grove.  It''s not in the life experiences of some.  Be sure to visit the mountains in autumn to see this sometime.  The sky''s blueness and the dappled light in the grove were the main elements of interest.  This image is straight from the camera.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: I was initially puzzled by the blue until I realized it was the sky. I think this would have done better with the sky completely blocked out or with a gray sky. It''s just too blotchy and distracting as is. Otherwise, Richard, this is a beautiful image. Just giving you my take on what I, and possibly other voters, saw.  Thanks, Art.  I appreciate your comments.  The Colorado sky does confuse people, especially when viewed through the leaves of an aspen grove.  It''s not in the life experiences of some.  Be sure to visit the mountains in autumn to see this sometime.  The sky''s blueness and the dappled light in the grove were the main elements of interest.  This image is straight from the camera.', '2012-03-22 09:00:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719872, 1002553, 19825, '<td valign="top">You are the master. This is a compelling shot. I am happy to see that it did well. Congrats on the ribbon -- this was a tough challenge.</td>', 'You are the master. This is a compelling shot. I am happy to see that it did well. Congrats on the ribbon -- this was a tough challenge.', '2012-03-22 09:05:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719874, 1004490, 136235, '<td valign="top">What an image: so much movement and all perfectly framed. It does a fantastic job of evoking memories of christmas because the scene is so easy to relate to. IMO one of the best in the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-23 10:55:58.</i></td>', 'What an image: so much movement and all perfectly framed. It does a fantastic job of evoking memories of christmas because the scene is so easy to relate to. IMO one of the best in the challenge.', '2012-03-22 09:13:31.000000', '2012-03-23 10:55:58.000000', 0),
(6719879, 1004166, 19825, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, Anita. I honestly can think of no one better on DPC to represent the pursuit of Art, so I am happy to see an image of yours in the top ten of this particular challenge. Congrats on the beautiful image, high placement, and a growing portfolio of fascinating work.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, Anita. I honestly can think of no one better on DPC to represent the pursuit of Art, so I am happy to see an image of yours in the top ten of this particular challenge. Congrats on the beautiful image, high placement, and a growing portfolio of fascinating work.', '2012-03-22 09:32:02.000000', NULL, 0),
