(6719935, 1002072, 63218, '<td valign="top">I fell in love with this one &amp; gave it a 10. When I look at the challenge results, it says my vote was a 10, but when I look at the voting distribution on this shot it shows you got 0 votes of 10. I don''t get it. Grr!<br/> <br/>I agree, it would look awesome on canvas, framed &amp; hung with one of those small museum lights on it. In fact, it reminds me of some of my best museum experiences. I didn''t notice it isn''t tack sharp, but then that is not a high priority with me. It''s the light on your subject I admire.</td>', 'I fell in love with this one & gave it a 10. When I look at the challenge results, it says my vote was a 10, but when I look at the voting distribution on this shot it shows you got 0 votes of 10. I don''t get it. Grr! I agree, it would look awesome on canvas, framed & hung with one of those small museum lights on it. In fact, it reminds me of some of my best museum experiences. I didn''t notice it isn''t tack sharp, but then that is not a high priority with me. It''s the light on your subject I admire.', '2012-03-22 11:13:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6719940, 1004118, 112739, '<td valign="top">(2)- 1 votes. I guess that shows the interpretation of art really is a personal thing. For me, this  image creates multiple feelings. Just when you think you seem to have things under control, along comes an issue. Or, go ahead and enjoy all life has to offer, but remember what is waiting at the end of it. Lots of interpretations. Great shot Alessandro, congrats on a very strong finish with lots of great entries.</td>', '(2)- 1 votes. I guess that shows the interpretation of art really is a personal thing. For me, this  image creates multiple feelings. Just when you think you seem to have things under control, along comes an issue. Or, go ahead and enjoy all life has to offer, but remember what is waiting at the end of it. Lots of interpretations. Great shot Alessandro, congrats on a very strong finish with lots of great entries.', '2012-03-22 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
