(6720193, 1004633, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Love the blur and the tones and how the washed out background makes you focus in on the darker carriage where you see those little grey faces peeking right at you! It''s just right for photo impressionism!<br/> <br/>I gave you a shout out in the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1136462&amp;page=2#6720187" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Art of 2011 Appreciation thread</a>. This one was much underrated IMHO!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-22 15:49:43.</i></td>', 'Wonderful shot. Love the blur and the tones and how the washed out background makes you focus in on the darker carriage where you see those little grey faces peeking right at you! It''s just right for photo impressionism! I gave you a shout out in the Art of 2011 Appreciation thread. This one was much underrated IMHO!', '2012-03-22 15:49:06.000000', '2012-03-22 15:49:43.000000', 0),
