(6720418, 1004166, 66641, '<td valign="top">haha, i just messaged you but didn''t even realize rollover happened...no WAY, you did not get NINTH out of 241!!!  :D     What did I say?  Right up your alley!  This is absolutely phenomenal, I don''t even know what to say.  :)<br/> <br/>Front page is a comin, lady!</td>', 'haha, i just messaged you but didn''t even realize rollover happened...no WAY, you did not get NINTH out of 241!!!  :D     What did I say?  Right up your alley!  This is absolutely phenomenal, I don''t even know what to say.  :) Front page is a comin, lady!', '2012-03-22 18:58:54.000000', NULL, 0),
