(6720439, 1003840, 100831, '<td valign="top">the colors are terrific... but so is the blur. A ride we didn''t want to miss.</td>', 'the colors are terrific... but so is the blur. A ride we didn''t want to miss.', '2012-03-22 19:38:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720464, 1002604, 68504, '<td valign="top">I liked this a lot. Splendid art, but I am touched by the fetching socks as well.</td>', 'I liked this a lot. Splendid art, but I am touched by the fetching socks as well.', '2012-03-22 20:36:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720504, 1004166, 69324, '<td valign="top">Sometimes less is more, the stark simplicity of this gives it soul.  Nice work.</td>', 'Sometimes less is more, the stark simplicity of this gives it soul.  Nice work.', '2012-03-22 21:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720510, 1003627, 98339, '<td valign="top">ahhhh...this was yours!!!  LOVE IT!!!  What a fine job...</td>', 'ahhhh...this was yours!!!  LOVE IT!!!  What a fine job...', '2012-03-22 22:00:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720521, 1004546, 112739, '<td valign="top">This image has the reportage feel, but becomes art with the well constructed motif. Excellent, excellent. Congratulations on this achievement!</td>', 'This image has the reportage feel, but becomes art with the well constructed motif. Excellent, excellent. Congratulations on this achievement!', '2012-03-22 22:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720523, 1004599, 86799, '<td valign="top">Love this, and the peace you portray watching the water flow.  I''ve spent a lot of hours on the Little River in the Smokys doing the very same thing, and enjoying every minute.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'Love this, and the peace you portray watching the water flow.  I''ve spent a lot of hours on the Little River in the Smokys doing the very same thing, and enjoying every minute.  Beautiful work.', '2012-03-22 22:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720557, 1004061, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and intriguing, Neil.  Closeup of the lip of a waterfall?  Congrats on 4th!</td>', 'Beautiful and intriguing, Neil.  Closeup of the lip of a waterfall?  Congrats on 4th!', '2012-03-22 23:13:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720619, 1002120, 62318, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing.</td>', 'It''s amazing.', '2012-03-23 00:15:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720626, 1004427, 64086, '<td valign="top">I had a feeling this was yours when I first saw it. I gave it a 7 and I should have come back to spend some more time looking at it. It''s a perfectly composed found work of art with real abstract paint(plus red and white makes pink), a well placed sand crack and that even has some living material in it that I didn''t notice before. I think the pipe cleaner itself is what initially gave me a negative reaction, but now it''s having the opposite effect on me. I think it''s great that most people had a negative reaction to it and that my opinion has changed over time. Well done.</td>', 'I had a feeling this was yours when I first saw it. I gave it a 7 and I should have come back to spend some more time looking at it. It''s a perfectly composed found work of art with real abstract paint(plus red and white makes pink), a well placed sand crack and that even has some living material in it that I didn''t notice before. I think the pipe cleaner itself is what initially gave me a negative reaction, but now it''s having the opposite effect on me. I think it''s great that most people had a negative reaction to it and that my opinion has changed over time. Well done.', '2012-03-23 00:23:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720709, 1002553, 121949, '<td valign="top">wonderful image, love everything about it, especially that old door. Wish I had things like that to photograph around here.</td>', 'wonderful image, love everything about it, especially that old door. Wish I had things like that to photograph around here.', '2012-03-23 02:40:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720726, 1001922, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Kelli, and the processing is just perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful, Kelli, and the processing is just perfect.', '2012-03-23 02:45:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720750, 1003382, 106931, '<td valign="top">I missed voting in this challenge, but I was looking back through them and this is the only picture that compelled me to stop and leave a message. This is wonderful.. it looks like a painting. I love the sky... Thank you for sharing. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I missed voting in this challenge, but I was looking back through them and this is the only picture that compelled me to stop and leave a message. This is wonderful.. it looks like a painting. I love the sky... Thank you for sharing. Keep up the good work.', '2012-03-23 03:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720839, 1004490, 65319, '<td valign="top">Congrats to you!!! ;-)</td>', 'Congrats to you!!! ;-)', '2012-03-23 07:50:36.000000', NULL, 0),
