(6720884, 1004654, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great title that shows an understanding of what makes this photo magical. I love the way this disorients me. I just want you to know that this was in my personal Top 6.</td>', 'Great title that shows an understanding of what makes this photo magical. I love the way this disorients me. I just want you to know that this was in my personal Top 6.', '2012-03-23 08:51:24.000000', NULL, 0),
