(6720896, 1004540, 76335, '<td valign="top">The jury missed another one.</td>', 'The jury missed another one.', '2012-03-23 09:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720898, 1002553, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how the grillwork changes his face.</td>', 'I like how the grillwork changes his face.', '2012-03-23 09:07:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720917, 1004490, 15711, '<td valign="top">This one really brought me around after much discussion in the juror pool.  What a great idea.  Congrats.</td>', 'This one really brought me around after much discussion in the juror pool.  What a great idea.  Congrats.', '2012-03-23 09:34:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720921, 1004546, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the frame, the crop, the whole thing. It has such an intensity of not only story, but tones. It truly compelled me.  During the jury discussions, there were questions as to whether it was staged or not.  I said, no, that it was pure happenstance.  I hope I was right.  Either way, it was one of my tops from the very beginning.  Congrats on your 2nd award!</td>', 'I love the frame, the crop, the whole thing. It has such an intensity of not only story, but tones. It truly compelled me.  During the jury discussions, there were questions as to whether it was staged or not.  I said, no, that it was pure happenstance.  I hope I was right.  Either way, it was one of my tops from the very beginning.  Congrats on your 2nd award!', '2012-03-23 09:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720926, 1002524, 15711, '<td valign="top">I rarely give 10''s and this was my pick from the get-go.  It is art personified and glorified in my eyes.  Fantastic.  Congrats on your Jury Award.</td>', 'I rarely give 10''s and this was my pick from the get-go.  It is art personified and glorified in my eyes.  Fantastic.  Congrats on your Jury Award.', '2012-03-23 09:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720928, 1002269, 15711, '<td valign="top">You tricked me, you bugger!!  One of my picks from the start.  I didn''t think this was yours due to the blur, whereas sharper is usually your style.  Way to go, mate.  We had lots of discussion of this in the jury pool.  You aced it!  Congrats.</td>', 'You tricked me, you bugger!!  One of my picks from the start.  I didn''t think this was yours due to the blur, whereas sharper is usually your style.  Way to go, mate.  We had lots of discussion of this in the jury pool.  You aced it!  Congrats.', '2012-03-23 09:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720929, 1001961, 15711, '<td valign="top">Now that the Jury Awards have been announced, I can truly comment. This really struck me from the start.  I was amazed that this could be done in a photograph without "breaking the rules" editing.  Congrats on your HM.  There was much discussion about it and it was one of my picks from early on.</td>', 'Now that the Jury Awards have been announced, I can truly comment. This really struck me from the start.  I was amazed that this could be done in a photograph without "breaking the rules" editing.  Congrats on your HM.  There was much discussion about it and it was one of my picks from early on.', '2012-03-23 09:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720962, 1004244, 15711, '<td valign="top">This was a pick of mine from the start.  We had much discussion of it in the jury pool.  The tones.  The almost ghostly feel! Congrats on your HM! I''d print it on canvas (really big) and hang it on the wall.</td>', 'This was a pick of mine from the start.  We had much discussion of it in the jury pool.  The tones.  The almost ghostly feel! Congrats on your HM! I''d print it on canvas (really big) and hang it on the wall.', '2012-03-23 10:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720966, 1004214, 67697, '<td valign="top">Congrats :D  :D  :D</td>', 'Congrats :D  :D  :D', '2012-03-23 10:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720969, 1004490, 67697, '<td valign="top">Yeah Vlado!  What a beautiful slice of life photo.  Congrats on the Juried BLUE!!!</td>', 'Yeah Vlado!  What a beautiful slice of life photo.  Congrats on the Juried BLUE!!!', '2012-03-23 10:33:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720973, 1001961, 67697, '<td valign="top">You truly are an artist.  But I knew that before you won your Juried Yellow.  Congrats!</td>', 'You truly are an artist.  But I knew that before you won your Juried Yellow.  Congrats!', '2012-03-23 10:35:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6720996, 1002281, 63218, '<td valign="top">Good work. You should be pleased with how misunderstood this was. I know I would be, if it was mine. Glad you took a photo of it before you demolished it.</td>', 'Good work. You should be pleased with how misunderstood this was. I know I would be, if it was mine. Glad you took a photo of it before you demolished it.', '2012-03-23 10:44:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6721007, 1002281, 12611, '<td valign="top">Well done, on its face, and in light of the tremendous back-story.</td>', 'Well done, on its face, and in light of the tremendous back-story.', '2012-03-23 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6721039, 1003617, 65319, '<td valign="top">Karen, I really enjoyed this image!  I especially love the black horse shadowing the white horse.  A lovely choice for this challenge!  I wish I could take an image this powerful...:-)</td>', 'Karen, I really enjoyed this image!  I especially love the black horse shadowing the white horse.  A lovely choice for this challenge!  I wish I could take an image this powerful...:-)', '2012-03-23 11:25:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6721044, 1004244, 65319, '<td valign="top">Sharon, congrats on your HM!  I confess that I found a more instant love with your sister''s image.  So, please forgive me for my blurry enamored heart.  Both of you always hold my highest esteem though.  ;-)</td>', 'Sharon, congrats on your HM!  I confess that I found a more instant love with your sister''s image.  So, please forgive me for my blurry enamored heart.  Both of you always hold my highest esteem though.  ;-)', '2012-03-23 11:32:53.000000', NULL, 0),
