(6721553, 1001924, 12253, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this isn''t in the top 20.  It''s fantastic.  One thought: maybe (if this is a crop) you could try some tilts so the fish are less vertical?</td>', 'I''m surprised this isn''t in the top 20.  It''s fantastic.  One thought: maybe (if this is a crop) you could try some tilts so the fish are less vertical?', '2012-03-23 19:27:53.000000', NULL, 0),
